      "claim": "LLM evaluation is a significant topic that cannot be fully covered in a single resource.",
      "source_id": "9735501bb2cc019c",
      "evidence_quote": "Of course, LLM evaluation is a very big topic that can’t be exhaustively covered in a single resource, but I think that having a clear mental map of these main approaches makes it much easier to interpret benchmarks, leaderboards, and papers.",
      "confidence": 0.9
