      "claim": "External tools like code interpreters or calculators can be used when comparing extracted answers with provided answers.",
      "source_id": "9735501bb2cc019c",
      "evidence_quote": "When we compare the extracted answer with the provided answer, as shown in figure above, we can employ external tools, such as code interpreters or calculator-like tools/software.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    },
    {
      "claim": "The blog will cover what LLM Evaluation is, why it's needed, its main types, automatic metrics, human evaluation, LLM as a Judge, task-specific and safety evaluation, common challenges, and best practices.",
