      "evidence_quote": "In this blog, we will learn about LLM Evaluation. We will understand what it is, why we need it, the main types of evaluation, the automatic metrics and benchmarks we can use, human evaluation, LLM as a Judge, task-specific and safety evaluation, the common challenges, and the best practices to follow.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    },
    {
      "claim": "LLM evaluations are necessary to compare results from new experiments or changes.",
      "source_id": "cef18857fdca65d2",
      "evidence_quote": "Each change is a new experiment, and you need LLM evaluations to compare their results.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    },
    {
      "claim": "The system includes a quantitative benchmark that covers factual retrieval, cross-modal retrieval, analytical/multi-hop synthesis, and conversational personalized follow-up.",
